        {
            "title": "兩大藍籌晶片股撐市  華虹曾升逾7%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">兩大藍籌晶片股今早（2026年11月19日）逆市揚升，華虹宏力(01347)為升幅最大藍籌股，中芯(00981)則貢獻恒指最多。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">華虹宏力一度漲7.04%，高見82.85元，中芯國際曾升5.99%，見52.15元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260326_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中芯國際官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260326_FI_source-web_00981.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：中芯國際官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>晶圓代工加價預期升溫</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">業內傳出芯片設計公司已陸續收到晶圓代工廠的調價通知，漲幅在10%至逾20%不等。台積電更計劃2027年對先進及成熟制程調價，並對HPC新單加收溢價。招商證券認為，中芯國際、華虹等或上調部分品類代工價格，報表端ASP有望提升，展望2027年部分產線執行新價格後ASP可繼續上行。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>國產化邏輯強化</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在海外AI監管與銷售收緊的背景下，國產算力需求確定性增強。行業觀察人士指出，中國模型公司需要轉向國產芯片，國產芯片和晶圓代工的需求更加確定。中國銀河證券也指出，芯片板塊正從受海外情緒壓制，轉向按“海外收入敞口、國產化能力、業績兌現程度”重新定價，具備本土需求支撐的環節有望率先走出結構性修覆。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>英偉達財報的側面催化</strong></p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英偉達發布黃仁勳離任後的首份財報，單季度營收首次突破千億美元，數據中心業務營收1076億美元，按年增長1.1倍。這一數據在一定程度上印證了AI算力需求的持續性，間接刺激晶片產業鏈情緒。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17214172-%e5%85%a9%e5%a4%a7%e8%97%8d%e7%b1%8c%e6%99%b6%e7%89%87%e8%82%a1%e6%92%90%e5%b8%82-%e8%8f%af%e8%99%b9%e6%9b%be%e5%8d%87%e9%80%be7",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/20260902_FI_source-web_01347.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 10:15:30",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "家電股逆市升 海爾智家創3個月高 出口與政策均利好",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">正當港股連兩萬三也失守之際，家電股卻逆造造好，海爾智家(06690)更創3個月新高；家電出口數字理想，疊加「以舊換新」政策，均有助板塊氣氛。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至上午約10時10分，海爾智家報22.48元，升2.93%，成交1.46億元；另一藍籌家電股美的集團(00300)也升0.98%，報103.6元，雙雙成為今早少數逆市報升的恒指成分股。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非藍籌的海信家電(00921)升勢更勁，暫報20.32元，漲6.44%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17214217-%e5%ae%b6%e9%9b%bb%e8%82%a1%e9%80%86%e5%b8%82%e5%8d%87-%e6%b5%b7%e7%88%be%e6%99%ba%e5%ae%b6%e5%89%b53%e5%80%8b%e6%9c%88%e9%ab%98-%e5%87%ba%e5%8f%a3%e8%88%87%e6%94%bf%e7%ad%96%e5%9d%87%e5%88%a9",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/20260326_FI_source-web_06690-1.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 10:15:30",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "港股跌穿23,000   騰訊阿里成跌市元兇",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數跌破23,000關，低見22,955，瀉339點或1.45%，現跌325點或1.4%，報22,969，成交額341.22億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數跌62點或1.67，報3,673 ; 恒生國企指數跌1.31%，報7,733。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"騰訊 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250116_FI_source-ap_China_Tencent_Group-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"騰訊 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250116_FI_source-ap_China_Tencent_Group-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">騰訊 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">成交341.22億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)挫4.88%，報354.6元，拖低恒指73點 ; 阿里巴巴(09988)插5.04%，報80.95元，拖低指69點，為兩大跌市元兇。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17214041-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e8%b7%8c%e7%a9%bf23000-%e9%a8%b0%e8%a8%8a%e9%98%bf%e9%87%8c%e6%88%90%e8%b7%8c%e5%b8%82%e5%85%83%e5%85%87",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-6.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 09:53:40",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
